  "liner": {
   "body_md": "## Setlist highlights\n\n- **She Left Me Standing On The Mountain**: rare: 3 archived performances [4]\n- **Love Or Confusion**: rare: 8 archived performances [4]\n- **Wait A Minute**: rare: 5 archived performances [4]\n- **Sliding Rock**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [4]\n- **Presentation Of The Key To The City**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [4]\n- **Old Train**: back after 91 archived shows (672 days) [4]\n- **I'll Cry Instead**: back after 62 archived shows (410 days); rare: 8 archived performances [4]\n- **I Don't Want Your Rambling Letters**: back after 577 archived shows (3914 days); rare: 4 archived performances [4]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **billystrings122026-02-14** (recommended): source not stated; 26 songs; 151 min [1]\n- **billystrings12026-02-14**: source not stated; 26 songs; 151 min [2]\n\n## Around the show\n\n- Reviewer says they attended the show in person [3]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **billystrings122026-02-14**: taped by Michael Clark; transferred by Michael Clark; source: Neumann ak20/ak40 MidSide->Lunatec V3-> Sound Devices 744 [1]. Also: Processed with iZotope RX9 for declicking, decrackle, fades and dither, then tagged and converted to FLAC in DB Poweramp; Recording credited with Christopher Henry and Mark Lavengoog [1]\n- **billystrings12026-02-14**: taped by Michael Clark; transferred by Brian Lee; source: Neumann ak20/ak40 MidSide-> Lunatec V3-> Neumann ak50s (DINA)-> Lunatec V3-> Sound Devices 744 [2]. Also: Processed in iZotope RX 11 Pro (balance, gain, mix, deverb) plus FabFilter Q4 and L2 for fades and dither; Tagged and converted to FLAC with DB Poweramp; credited with Christopher Henry and Mark Lavengoog [2]",
